monitors.message:
{{#is_alert}}
The video classroom room creation failure rate has exceeded 10% over the last 10 minutes. This indicates problems with the LiveKit integration or infrastructure.

**Current value:** {{value}}%
**Threshold:** 10%

**Actions:**
1. Check LiveKit service health and connectivity.
2. Inspect backend logs for token generation or room creation errors.
3. Verify LiveKit API credentials are valid.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
Room creation failure rate elevated.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_alert}}
The video classroom room join failure rate has exceeded 15% over the last 10 minutes. Users may be unable to connect to existing video rooms.

**Current value:** {{value}}%
**Threshold:** 15%

**Actions:**
1. Check LiveKit service health and connectivity.
2. Verify token generation is succeeding for join operations.
3. Inspect whether rooms are being created with correct identifiers.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
Room join failure rate elevated.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_alert}}
The average LiveKit token generation duration has exceeded 2 seconds over the last 10 minutes. This adds latency to the user experience when starting or joining video calls.

**Current value:** {{value}}s
**Threshold:** 2s

**Actions:**
1. Check LiveKit server latency and JWKS endpoint availability.
2. Verify JWT signing key rotation is not causing delays.
3. Inspect backend CPU and memory usage.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
Token generation latency elevated.
{{/is_warning}}

{{#is_alert}}
The average video classroom room duration has exceeded 2 hours. This may indicate abandoned rooms that are not being cleaned up or an issue with the LiveKit empty timeout configuration.

**Current value:** {{value}}s
**Threshold:** 7200s (2 hours)

**Actions:**
1. Check LiveKit room list for rooms without active participants.
2. Verify the emptyTimeout configuration (currently 30s) is functioning correctly.
3. Inspect LiveKit webhook events for room_finished notifications.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_warning}}
Average room duration elevated.
{{/is_warning}}
